Inventory Share native inventory synchronization bridge

Built using Endstone v0.11.15 (commit b4aaa87d2c5305e7d340168f824ac2e2ea722e44).
Copyright (c) 2023, The Endstone Project. Apache License 2.0.
https://github.com/EndstoneMC/endstone
The build substitutes two formatting expressions in a generated copy of
bedrock/platform/result.h for standalone compiler compatibility. No inventory
method or ABI layout is changed; the pinned SDK checkout is left untouched.

Build/header dependencies: Boost 1.91.0, EnTT 3.16.0, expected-lite 0.9.0,
GLM 1.0.3, Microsoft GSL 4.2.2, Endstone RakNet 4.081-mojang (r26u3),
and pybind11 3.0.1. Linux bundles LLVM libc++/libc++abi 20.
Corresponding copyright notices and license texts accompany this file in licenses/.

The bridge source and reproducible build recipe are in the Inventory Share
repository's native/ directory. No Bedrock server executable is distributed.
